![Esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu (2): Esharunoto tiatua Osotua Ng'ejuk.. O Ewueji e Nkisianaroto oo Lsing'a](/images/posts/nt-redemption-mas.png)

> "Amu meewuo Enkerai e Enkai pe isiaayiareki, kake eewuo pe isiaayiare, o pe ishoo enkishui enye eaku esharunoto oo ltasujak ake kumok" (Marko 10:45).


Eiting'o iyiook te embaata dukuya te esipa e Ororei le Nkai nemedidimayu esul katukul: Kikiata iyiook sile te Enkai naaitame ng'ok te supatisho, o meeta enjeunoto nemeata olekoisiayio loo ng'ok; eiyieu enjeunoto "olautaroni le osotua ng'ejuk" oidia aitashe te wueji lang o aalak pooki olekoisiayio loo ng'ok te supatisho e Enkai naaitame ng'ok. Neibulu ororei le Nkai tiatua enkop e Rumi apa natii ilsing'a kumok. Te ena wueji, eigelua Enkiyang'et Sinyati iroriek le Nkai pe eibalie nias supati pooki e Yesu.

---

## Erolok e Yunani O Ewueji e Nkisianaroto oo Lsing'a (Lutron) ↩

Etaa te nkisoma enkiroroto "esharunoto" aashu "Lutron" tiatua Osotua Ng'ejuk, eidim atii te nkiyama e tung'ani ajo "enjeunoto" ake kiti. Kake meeta ena kisiligata esipa e Enkai [1].

Te enkop nemeyiol Enkai e Yunani o Rumi apa, meituruki iroriek le esharunoto (anaa Lutron) te njuria e enjeunoto nemeata esile. Kake ekuena enkiguenata sapuk e koti tiatua "ewueji e nkisianaroto oo lsing'a". Esharunoto (Lutron) naa: olekoisiayio loo ng'ok oalakaki pe eilak olsing'ani o aisho enkotunoto nasipa tiatua Kristo, aashu olekoisiayio loo ng'ok oalakaki pe eitayu olarrabal.

Kaa nias idimayu enkotunoto nasipa e lsing'ani apa? Te esupatisho e koti te ilo ndaman, meeta olsing'ani enkitoria e nkop enye; pooki toki naata naa e olaitoriani lenye te nkitoria e koti. Te nkaraki ina, oho te neata olsing'ani olekoisiayio loo ng'ok aalak esharunoto enye, eidim olaitoriani ayau ilo ropiyian anaa onye o aitonie olsing'ani tiatua sile! Pe eitayu te ena sile e koti, elo olsing'ani aalak iropiyiani te nkasuku inenkai e lmeek. Neeku eigelua olapolosani ilo sing'ani te nkaraki enkai e lmeek. Neeku ena: eilak olsing'ani te olaitoriani lenye le nkop, kake te ina sautu eaku "olsing'ani olaisianareki e enkai o malki enye" [2]. Eyieu olsing'ani "olautaroni le osotua ng'ejuk" (enkai/olapolosani) pe eipir tiatua enkiguenata e koti o asilig enkisirata e lkisianaroto.

Te ene kikira adol eramatare e Enkai te pooki ntokitin sapuk; anaa pe eitumi Enkai nkiguenat e Osotua Musana o nkisainot pe eitobirie iltauja le Yahudi asharu "Olasharuni", neitumi sii ina "ewueji e nkisianaroto oo lsing'a" o nkotunot te lmeek le Yunani o Rumi pe eitobirie nkoshok oo lmeek aiyiolou esharunoto sapuk te nkop! Mme enjeunoto emayianata nemeata esile ake neing'uaa shumata, kake naa "esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu" nasipa naalakie Yesu olekoisiayio loo ng'ok lang pe eilak iyiook te sile e ng'ok pe kintotiwuo malki enye pooki. Anaa pe ejo Oltumwa: > "Amu eisiang'aki intae te olekoisiayio. Te nkaraki ina entoita Enkisisa Sapuk e Enkai te seseni linyi o te nkiyang'et inyi naa e Enkai" (1 Korinthos 6:20).

---

## Eibalie ororei kiti esipa e "Esharunoto te ndukuya" (Anti = te wueji e) ↩

Ejo Olaitoriani Yesu: > "Amu meewuo Enkerai e Enkai pe isiaayiareki, kake eewuo pe isiaayiare, o pe ishoo enkishui enye eaku esharunoto te ndukuya e [anti-lutron] kumok" (Marko 10:45, Matayo 20:28). Ororei le Yunani oibalieki "te ndukuya e" te ene naa (anti) tiatua ororei obo (anti-lutron) [3].

Eibalie ele ororei (oigelua Enkiyang'et Sinyati te nkirukoto e Ilkigerot pooki naa Enkai nayang'ua) te esipa e nkia Yesu Oloyelieki le Enkai naisho enkishui enye aaku esharunoto te wueji lang. Tiatua erolok e Yunani, mejo (anti) "te nkaraki" tung'ani ake, kake ejo ashe toki aashu tung'ani te wueji e likai: "te ndukuya e" aashu "te wueji e" (In place of / In exchange for). Enkitanyaanyukoto nasipa te Nkisirata e Septuagint naa enkiguenata e koti: > "Enkong'u te ndukuya e (anti) enkong'u" [4]. Naa enkisianaroto pooki.

Neidung'o ene Osotua Ng'ejuk o olikioroto sapuk le (Isaya 53). Eyau iroriek le Yesu ndukuya e enkong'u "olsing'ani osandaki" oya ng'ok e kulikae: > "Kake etaurio te nkaraki ng'ok ang, eturumbokio te nkaraki e ntorroni ang, eitarakuaki te nkaraki e serian ang... neitonie Olaitoriani te shumata ninye ng'ok lang pooki... amu etaari te nkaraki ng'ok e tung'anak lang... o ng'ok enye keya ninye... neshum ninye ng'ok e kumok neya isile loo ltorrok" (Isaya 53:5-12). Eitayu ele ororei (Anti-lutron) pooki eitaaroto te ndukuya e Esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu! Meewuo Yesu Oloyelieki le Enkai pe esandi "te nebo" iyiook te osotua, kake eewuo pe etauri o aturumbokini o ataari te wueji lang, te wueji otaari iyiook te nkaraki ng'ok ang naaya ninye te wueji lang. Eitashe te wueji e kitashe iyiook, netameki anaa olmoroki o olyasi ltorrok eya enkiguenata nasipa, nemeeta olekoisiayio loo ng'ok oalakaki.

Eitagaar Oltumwa Paulo ena kiroroto te ng'olon tiatua (1 Timoteo 2:6) naitolimuo Yesu Oloyelieki le Enkai anaa: > "Oishoo enkishui enye aaku esharunoto te ndukuya e pooki". Ororei oitumiki ene naa ilo ororei obo (Anti-lutron) naajo "esharunoto te ndukuya e pooki", naibalieki esipa: "Esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu".

Anaa pe ejo Paulo sii: > "Oishoori ntarasi e keeya te nkaraki ng'ok ang, nepiunye pe kipik e esupatisho e Enkai tiatua enkoisiayio" (Roma 4:25). Eishoori Yesu Oloyelieki le Enkai te nkiguenata e keeya "te nkaraki ng'ok ang" (ororei le Yunani Dia "te nkaraki" eibalie "amu": amu ng'ok ang) [5]; etaa ng'ok ang nasipa naaitieu ena Esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu.

Meing'oru Yesu enkutukaji e ng'ok aisuuj iyiook, kake elote ninye tiatua enkutukaji e koti, eya ewueji lang, nela olekoisiayio loo ng'ok pooki te Enkai naaitame ng'ok te esandata o keeya enye te msalaba, nekiipang iyiook anaa ilotunot "te esupatisho e Enkai tiatua enkoisiayio" o "Etotiwuo ng'ejuk te nkiyang'et".

---

## Kaa nyor olekoisiayio loo ng'ok aalak pe eaku esharunoto? ↩

Kitoduaa tiatua Osotua Musana ajo eisho Olaisraeli "iropiyiani e esharunoto" te Enkai anaa esharunoto te enkishui enye (Oloipang'ie 30). Kake, tiatua Osotua Ng'ejuk, kaa nyor olekoisiayio loo ng'ok olaaki pe kigilu iyiook tiatua ewueji e nkisianaroto oo lsing'a?

Ewal Oltumwa Petero te ebalata tiatua (1 Petero 1:18-19):

> "Miyiololo ajo kintajeuni intae te Esharunoto mme te ntokitin naamut, te lpil aashu isina... kake te osarge le nkanyit, anaa o olkuoo le meeta entorroni aashu oloirobi, osarge le Yesu Oloyelieki le Enkai."

Meeta olekoisiayio loo ng'ok ropiyian naamut, kake naa enkishui e Enkerai e Enkai ototiwuo tung'ani; etaa olekoisiayio loo ng'ok > "...osarge le Yesu Oloyelieki le Enkai, oishoo enkishui enye te nkiyang'et e ntarasi te Enkai meeta entorroni..." (Ilhebrania 9:14). Osarge tiatua Ororei le Nkai naa enkishui, anaa pe ejo Ilkigerot pooki naa Enkai nayang'ua: > "Amu nkiyang'et e sesen e tiatua osarge, amu aishoo intae te olperere le nkishomi pe iitaaru Esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu te nkaraki inkiyang'etin inyi, amu osarge leitaaru esharunoto te nkaraki enkiyang'et" (Illaawi 17:11). Tene meiposhokini enkia e "Esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu" natii te ororei "pe iitaaru esharunoto te nkaraki inkiyang'etin inyi"; amu keeya (aikut osarge) ake natii Esharunoto naitobir Enkai naaitame ng'ok te supatisho te nkaraki ng'ok ang o enkiterrakinoto ang te Naɨtɛ́rʉkɔ́p. Pe kintotiwuo ilotunot, eiyieu elaak ena Esharunoto aashu olekoisiayio loo ng'ok e nkotunoto. Neewuo olautaroni le osotua ng'ejuk (Yesu Oloyelieki le Enkai) o aalak enkishui enye o osarge lenye sinyati anaa (Esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu - Anti-lutron) pe aitaaku Esharunoto naitobir Enkai naaitame ng'ok te supatisho e Papa Enkai pooki.

Te nkaraki ina, te neitagaar Oltumwa Paulo: > "Kipik Esupatisho e Enkai tiatua enkoisiayio nemeata esile te Emayianata e Enkai ake te Esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu Oloyelieki le Enkai" (Roma 3:24), eikikita iyiook ajo esupatisho e Enkai tiatua enkoisiayio naa "nemeata esile" te iyiook ake, amu mikilaak toki, kake metaa nemeata esile katukul te Enkai; eitaa ninye aalak pooki toki. Ena naa "enkibelekenyata sapuk" nairorie eSírít e Kristo e yieyio e nkolong' tiatua inkomon enye ajo: "Iyiook apa ng'ok o ninye osandaki. Iyiook kiaku eata sile te Enkai naaitame ng'ok te nkaraki ng'ok ang o ninye olaaka sile te wueji lang" [6]. Iyiook ilsing'a oota sile, o Ninye Olaitoriani olaaka olekoisiayio loo ng'ok e Esharunoto te osarge lenye sinyati!

---

## Enjeunoto tiatua ewueji e nkisianaroto ↩

Eibalie iroriek ootumia Ilkigerot pooki naa Enkai nayang'ua pe eibalie Esharunoto (Lutron) o Esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu (Anti-Lutron) te esipa sapuk ajo Enjeunoto ang eigilu te nkia e "ndukuya" eitayunoki olekoisiayio loo ng'ok sapuk "osarge le Enkerai e Enkai" (1 Yohana 1:7), aashu anaa pe ejo Paulo Oltumwa "osarge le Enkai" neirorie Inkirorot oo lpayiani le sirit le Efeso: > "... pe iramat eSírít e Kristo natisiraki te nebo osotua le Neema e Enkai, naitagolu te osarge lenye" (Ikias 20:28), pe ejeu iyiook te nkisianaroto pe kiaku malki e Enkai.

Tiatua embaata naalo apuonu, kigira ashomo dukuya aing'ur nkirorot e Osotua Ng'ejuk naapir esharunoto.

Isomayia sii tiatua enkisoma e Esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu:
Embaata dukuya: Esharunoto tiatua Osotua Musana.. Ng'ae Olautaroni le osotua ng'ejuk?

---

## Ing'elunot O Lkigerot pooki ↩

## 1. Morris, Leon. Elikioroto e Ororei le Nkai le Msalaba (The Apostolic Preaching of the Cross), Embaata Dukuya: Esharunoto.
## 2. Eibalie olayiolouni le rorei Adolf Deissmann ajo eiyiolouni ena kias apa anaa (Sacral Manumission).
## 3. Eitagaar Dkt. Olapolosani Ghassan Khalaf tiatua enkisoma enye e rorei le Yunani ajo eitumiki ororei "Anti-lutron" aibalie esharunoto anaa ndukuya naitobir, wueji eya Olasharuni wueji le ilo oshara.
## 4. Nkisirata e Septuagint naa enkisirata e Yunani e Osotua Musana (Illaawi 24:20).
## 5. Eibalie Olapolosani Ghassan Khalaf ajo eibalie ororei (Dia / διά) o wueji "Te nkaraki" (Because of / On account of), naitagaar ajo etaa ng'ok ang "entoki" naaitieu enkishoroto e Yesu Oloyelieki le Enkai enkishui enye aaku esharunoto te ndukuya e Yesu.
## 6. Inkomon Sinyati e Nkidung'oto (Nkidung'oto e Syria), Liturjia e eSírít e Kristo e Coptic Orthodox. (Ing'ura wueji e mtandao e Anba Tekla).

